></mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>4</mn></menclose></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>Therefore, the solution is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> The solution can be expressed on a number line, as shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-44742-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-44742-a-1\"></div></div></div>",
